  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>An <html:em>element of a presheaf</html:em> <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[P]]></fr:tex> at an object <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[c]]></fr:tex> is an element <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[x]]></fr:tex> of the set <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[P c]]></fr:tex>.</html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
